WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
A few goes with countables, a little with uncountables.. How many and how much

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
are not interchangeable.. Adjective order: opinion, size, age, shape, colour,

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
origin.. Prepositions shift with context: in, on, at, by.. Do not confuse the

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
pair structures both, either and neither.. So and such create different

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
emphasis.. Cleft sentences add emphasis: it is ... that.. Inversion is formal

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
and strong: never have I.. Shorten a sentence with a participle clause.. In

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
writing, a semicolon joins two independent clauses..
